cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite it as below. This is a fork of the
  OpenHW Group's CORE-V CVA6 carrying the FaMAF CVA6 Project's additions. The
  upstream core and its paper are cited under references.
title: "FaMAF CVA6 Project: a CVA6 fork calibrated against gem5's MinorCPU"
abstract: >-
  A frozen fork of the OpenHW Group CORE-V CVA6, used as the real-hardware side
  of a study of how closely a gem5 MinorCPU configuration can be made to match a
  real RISC-V core. It adds the matched gem5 configurations and the gem5 patch
  they depend on, the calibration benchmark set and its sweep harness, the
  Verilator and gem5 run drivers, and the Docker images that run both sides.
